<p class="lead">
  Almost every unit conversion you'll ever do is a multiplication: a mile is always 1.609 kilometers, a pound is always 0.4536 kilograms, no matter what the actual value is. Temperature breaks that pattern, and the reason is worth understanding rather than just memorizing the formula.
</p>

